message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "RenalGenetics Decision Support"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Oates
    given-names: Tom
version: 1.0.1
date-released: 2026-07-30
url: "https://github.com/toates19/RenalGenetics-Decision-Support"
abstract: >
  A Shiny-based decision-support tool for non-genetics nephrology
  clinicians navigating NHS genomic testing pathways for suspected
  inherited renal disease. Covers eligibility scoring across 12 NHS
  genomic testing panels, a Bayesian diagnostic model spanning 24
  gene-level conditions, and a variant interpretation module (196
  genes across 38 condition groups). Beta software, not validated
  for clinical use.
